  "StockRole": "Heavy Fire Support",
  "YangsThoughts": "Two Light Ultra Gauss Rifles, a pair of iATM-12s, and jump jets on a ninety-tonner. DeVega can reach you, pick the right ammunition for the job, and start punching holes before you figure out where he's firing from. Clan Wolf, ComStar, MoC, Society... Boss, I don't care who this guy actually works for. Just make sure it stays us.",
